5,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I would like to look into the staffing of the coordination group and the in-house developer availability, please.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I think it would be wise to check the network coverage at customer plants and the in-house developer availability as well. I want to ensure we have a clear picture of the technical constraints.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I will look into the capital budget and software allowance, as well as vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work. It is important to know exactly what we can afford before we commit.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I'll take a look at the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts. It's time we see what actually sticks around after the excitement fades, don't you think?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think it would be helpful to see the time lost to copying existing records and the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs. I want to understand the actual daily struggles our staff are facing.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I think those are all very good choices. I am glad we are looking at so many different things. Does anyone else want to change their selection, or are we all happy?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am satisfied with my choices. They should provide the necessary context regarding our external dependencies and internal capacity.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I am satisfied as well. It is better to be thorough now than to find ourselves in a difficult position later. I will stick with my selections.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm perfectly happy with mine. I think we've covered the bases quite well—from the money to the actual mistakes. Let's just see what the data tells us.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm happy with my choices too. It feels like we're looking at this from all the right angles, and I'm looking forward to seeing what the records show.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"Since we all agree, I think we are ready to move forward. I am looking forward to hearing what everyone finds out.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us proceed to the investigation phase so we can bring these facts back to the table.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,Indeed. Let us see what the records reveal. I believe a grounded approach is the only way to ensure this project's success.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm ready when you are. Let's get to the good part and see if we actually learn anything new this year.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's move forward and see how these details can help us make the best choice for everyone involved.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I will say ""Over"" for this round, as we have all confirmed our choices and are ready to see the results.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
